     5	# Part 2 (new boot):  verify REH|ROOT|REL
     6	# Every step ends with PASS or FAIL. A FAIL never deletes anything: fix the cause and run the same step again.
     7	# State (run name, keyring path, fingerprint) is kept in /tmp/tessera-ceremony.env, in RAM.
     8	# This script never writes a secret anywhere except the LUKS backup volume, and writes only public files to the
     9	# public stick. Read it before running it: that, not the checksum, is what protects against a bad script.
